data: {"sequence_number":80,"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_scrubbed","output_index":2,"text":"**The Reserve Bank of India's current policy repo rate is 5.50%, last changed on October 7, 2026, when the MPC unanimously raised it by 25 basis points from 5.25%.**[[1]](https://rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_PressReleaseDisplay.aspx?prid=63742)[[2]](https://www.rbi.org.in/Home.aspx/Webservice/scripts/Scripts/Scripts/femaview.aspx?femaid=66)\n\nThis is confirmed on the RBI's official website and recent policy statements/minutes.","logprobs":[]}

